                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I spoke with @chloecole about this issue on Hold These Truths. My bill to ban federal funding for hospitals that perform gender transition procedures on minors is about protecting children and restoring accountability in medicine. Taxpayers should not subsidize this, and children should not be suffering through it.\n\nListen here: https://t.co/GJKT9IBqMZ",
