                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For years, radical activists hijacked the medical field. They bullied doctors into silence, rebranded experimentation as compassion, and used vulnerable kids as pawns in a culture war.\n\nThis report reminds us: protecting kids means saying no to unproven, irreversible treatments pushed on vulnerable youth. Medicine should heal, not experiment.",
