                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This review was led by medical professionals and ethicists from across the political spectrum, because facts aren\u2019t partisan. \n\nEven under intense cultural pressure, HHS stood firm: the evidence does not justify these procedures on children. Good science. Good ethics. And most importantly, a good step toward protecting America\u2019s kids.",
