                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "WaPo cites the medical establishment to force you into believing \u201cgender transition procedures\u201d are unquestionable, or \u201cmedically necessary.\u201d\n\nSpoiler: They\u2019re not.\n\nThe Crenshaw Amendment stops your tax dollars from funding them. And yes, it\u2019s a fight worth having.\ud83e\uddf5 https://t.co/Mcb6Pi1wRU",
