                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Remember lobotomies?\n\nDoctors once drilled into skulls and severed brain connections with ice picks\u2014over 40,000 performed in the U.S.\n\nBacked by the American Medical Association. Praised by elites. Even won a Nobel Prize.\n\nSound familiar? https://t.co/yrxJdqh37w",
