                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Forced sterilizations were once mainstream medicine too.\n\nState health boards approved them\u2014often targeting the poor, disabled, and \u201cundesirables.\u201d\n\nMedical consensus doesn\u2019t mean moral correctness. https://t.co/fJMXIJXeeE",
