                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In 2024, the U.K. commissioned the Cass Review\u2014the most thorough audit of pediatric gender medicine to date.\n\nIt reviewed 100+ studies. Verdict? Weak evidence. No proof these treatments improve mental health or reduce suicide.\n\nTrump\u2019s HHS found the same thing in its own independent review.",
