                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Crenshaw Amendment simply says the federal government shouldn\u2019t bankroll irreversible, experimental treatments\u2014especially when medical institutions have such a history of getting it wrong.\n\nAnd the American people agree.",
