                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Some things are obviously wrong.\n\nPuberty blockers for kids, double mastectomies on healthy girls, chemical castration, and enabling mentally troubled people to mutilate their bodies in the name of \u201cgender affirmation.\u201d\n\nIt\u2019s not health care. It\u2019s twisted activism and brainwashing by an industry set on creating lifelong patients.\n\nAnd it all ends with the Crenshaw Amendment.",
