                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "When nothing else is working for our veterans, we owe it to them to try what might.\n\nAt today\u2019s @HouseCommerce Health hearing, I asked @HHSgov @SecKennedy for a status update on psychedelic research for PTSD and TBI. Glad to hear the Trump Administration is on board \u2014 and that results continue to be strong.\n\nI passed legislation to fund more clinical trials two years ago \u2014 and I can\u2019t wait to see where the science goes.",
